    "heading": "Proficiency",
    "lineStart": 13568,
    "lineEnd": 13570
  },
  "section": "8.116",
  "rulesText": "If you have proficiency with something, you can add your Proficiency Bonus to any D20 Test you make using that thing. A creature might have proficiency in a skill or saving throw or with a weapon or tool. See also “Playing the Game” (“Proficiency”)."
}
